Audit complete: **CONCERNS / LEGIT**.

The proof rebuilt to `#Top`, pins the real program, and passed independent non-vacuity and body-sensitivity tests. The concern is the documented Unicode lowercase gap in the supplied semantics, qualifying for campaign amendment v2’s legitimate-model-gap exception.

